                // surrounding return-type context to lean on (`examples/genericenum.hc`'s own real,
                // reported failure). Enum-variant sibling of the struct fallback right below (see
                // its own header) -- `generic_enum_infer_owner`/`generic_enum_infer_field` are this
                // file's own precomputed substitute for `Checker.hotc`'s `generic_enum_templates`
                // registry, keyed by variant name (not the enum base) since which field carries the
                // inference is a per-variant question.
