                // itself category-1 -- a real, pre-existing gap found alongside the `FloatLit`/
                // `DoubleLit` port: a category-2 `value` (`Long`/`Double`, 2 words wide) below TWO
                // more category-1 words (`arrayref`, `index`) needs `DUP2_X2`'s own "Form 3"
                // instead (duplicate the top 2-word value, insert it below the next two 1-word
